---
kind: podcast-script
date: {{ context.date.isoformat() }}
script_version: {{ context.script_version }}
model: {{ context.model }}
item_count: {{ context.item_count }}
---

# Podcast — {{ context.date.isoformat() }}

{% if context.segments %}
{% for segment in context.segments %}
## {{ segment.label }}{{ teased_note if segment.teased else "" }}

{% for turn in segment.turns %}
**{{ turn.speaker }}:** {{ turn.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% if segment.sources %}

**Sources:**
{% for source in segment.sources %}
- [{{ escape_title(source.title) }}]({{ source.url }}) <!-- sf:item={{ source.item_id }} -->
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{% else %}
No episode today — nothing cleared the podcast script with a valid citation. Check
`signalforge status` if this is unexpected.

{% endif %}
{% if context.coverage_gaps %}
## Coverage gaps

*{{ context.coverage_gaps | length }} item(s) not covered:*

{% for gap in context.coverage_gaps %}
{% if gap.url is not none %}
- [{{ escape_title(gap.title) }}]({{ gap.url }}) — {{ reason_labels[gap.reason] }} <!-- sf:item={{ gap.item_id }} reason={{ gap.reason }} -->
{% else %}
- item {{ gap.item_id }} — {{ reason_labels[gap.reason] }} <!-- sf:item={{ gap.item_id }} reason={{ gap.reason }} -->
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
